<http://data.silknow.org/object/a02a52d8-c05c-3b91-9439-8a23c9a6ff6b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "High-waisted dress of yellow silk, with ivory coloured silks billows out in four openings at the top of the sleeves; a long rectangular strip of ivory silk is stitched to the inside of the sleeve head and the excess gathered into pudds through the openings. Long sleeves narrow at wrists with double bands at the cuffs and trimmed with ivory silk satin frills, yellow silk crêpe, cream ribbon and cording. Trimming around lower hem of skirt of applied vandyked border of ivory silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a02a52d8-c05c-3b91-9439-8a23c9a6ff6b> .

